ch or corner cut as a real finding and say what the long-term fix is. As a writer, implement the structural fix, not a containment patch; if staging is truly unavoidable, record the long-term design and name its roadmap row.  The branches wip/slice0-lexer-ws (e474d8f0) and wip/slice0-lexer-tokens (da687c9e), written by Kimi, stack on this one and will rebase afterwards: keep public names stable where the fix allows, and list every rename in your report. Run inside the repository's nix devshell, bounded: lake build of the touched targets, bash scripts/proofs/axioms.sh (or the axiom check the repo uses), bash scripts/proofs/trust_ban.sh, the trusted-base gate scripts/checks/compiler/slice0_trusted_base.sh, and bash scripts/checks/run.sh if it is cheap (say if not). No full suites beyond that. Do not edit docs/decisions.md or ROADMAP.md. Extend changelog.d/2026-11-08-lexer-utf8.md. Commit in logical commits. End with a short report: what changed per finding, theorem list, renames, gates run and results, anything left open.  agy's findings (verbatim): #### 1. [HIGH] Undecided lexical rules encoded in `Surface0` and `Concrete.Lex` (source-wide NUL/BOM pre-refusal and bare-`CR` line-comment termination) - **Locations**:   - [ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean:4-5](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-lexw1a/src/ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean#L4-L5), [ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean:56-59](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-lexw1a/src/ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean#L56-L59), [ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean:70-82](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-lexw1a/src/ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean#L70-L82), [ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean:122-123](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c